# Hard-gate precision — multi member_set counts in shared caveats
#
# Regression target: when an answer carries several principal
# member_set facts (types / functions / Kind constants),
# count validation must bind visible numbers to an explicit set label,
# not to any member name that happens to appear in shared scope prose.
# The prompt intentionally asks for category counts plus a scope note
# so the answer is allowed to mention multiple numbers near the same
# package members. It deliberately excludes variables so this case stays
# focused on hard-gate precision; language-wide exported API row fidelity
# is tracked separately under the Batch 1 ExportedAPIRow gap.
ID="qf_multi_member_set_count_caveat"
NAME="hard-gate precision — multi member-set count caveat"
QUESTION="internal/analysis/criterion 请只按类型、函数、Kind 常量三类列出公开符号；不要列变量；每一类必须列出完整成员名称并给出数量；在范围说明里说明 Kind const block 的数量依据。"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="Eval EvalAll RegisteredKinds KindExternalArtifactDecoded"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(类型.*(^|[^0-9])3([^0-9]|$)|(^|[^0-9])3([^0-9]|$).*类型)
(函数.*(^|[^0-9])5([^0-9]|$)|(^|[^0-9])5([^0-9]|$).*函数)
(Kind|常量).*(^|[^0-9])2[4-6]([^0-9]|$)"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="defaultExternalArtifactFloor private approximately roughly"
